#: help/templates/help/index.html:17
msgid ""
"Travel from community to community, join a tour for part of the way, plan "
"your own, and take gifts along."
msgstr ""
"Voyage de communauté en communauté, rejoins un tour pour une partie du "
"chemin, planifie le tien et emporte des dons."

#: help/templates/help/index.html:25 help/templates/help/tours.html:29
